   "This phone's Linux kernel uses %d KB memory pages, and Windows programs need 4 KB pages, so "
   "Roblox Studio cannot run on this phone. Nothing you can change in Boddy or Android fixes it.\n\n"
   "Making Roblox games still works: open Roblox Tools and choose \"Start a new game I can edit "
   "with an AI agent\"." % (PAGE_SIZE//1024))
